%%{init: {'theme': 'base'}}%%
flowchart TD
    Start([Test Failure Event]) --> Extract[Extract:<br/>• Failure Message<br/>• Stack Trace<br/>• Test Metadata<br/>• Screenshot / DOM if available]

    Extract --> Classify[LLM + Structured Output<br/>Classification]

    Classify --> Decision{Determined Type?}

    Decision -->|UI related| UI[UI_FAILURE]
    Decision -->|Locator| LOC[LOCATOR_FAILURE]
    Decision -->|Timeout / Sync| TO[TIMEOUT_FAILURE]
    Decision -->|HTTP / Contract| API[API_FAILURE]
    Decision -->|Data integrity| DATA[DATA_FAILURE]
    Decision -->|Service health| ENV[ENVIRONMENT_FAILURE]
    Decision -->|Auth / Session| AUTH[AUTH_FAILURE]
    Decision -->|Recent deploy correlation| DEP[DEPLOYMENT_FAILURE]
    Decision -->|Infra| INFRA[INFRASTRUCTURE_FAILURE]
    Decision -->|Assertion| ASSERT[ASSERTION_FAILURE]
    Decision -->|Intermittent pattern| FLAKY[FLAKY_FAILURE]
    Decision -->|Cannot determine| UNK[UNKNOWN_FAILURE]

    UI --> Conf{Confidence ≥ Threshold?}
    LOC --> Conf
    TO --> Conf
    API --> Conf
    DATA --> Conf
    ENV --> Conf
    AUTH --> Conf
    DEP --> Conf
    INFRA --> Conf
    ASSERT --> Conf
    FLAKY --> Conf
    UNK --> Escalate[Force Human Escalation]

    Conf -->|Yes| Route[Route to Orchestrator<br/>with Type + Confidence]
    Conf -->|No| Escalate

    Route --> Continue([Continue Investigation])
    Escalate --> Human([Human Review Required])

    style UNK fill:#fed7d7,stroke:#c53030
    style Escalate fill:#fed7d7,stroke:#c53030
    style Human fill:#feb2b2,stroke:#c53030
    style Route fill:#c6f6d5,stroke:#276749
    style Continue fill:#c6f6d5,stroke:#276749
